// FST_FieldMedicine -- Star Wars field-medicine items on ACE's bandage machinery (generated by
// D:\ACEMedical\tools\gen_fieldmedicine.py; edit the generator, not this file).
// Kolto Wrap (everyday surface wraps), Coagulant Foam (deep bleeders), Synthflesh Sheet (burns / surface), and a
// rebalance of IDA's Bacta Bandage (no longer 5x on medium/large deep wounds). Pairs with plasma wound mix B2
// (FST_IDA_ACE_Compat v3): B2 makes the wound types varied; these make the right item matter.
// Bandages never touch trauma, so durability (knock-down / death) is unchanged. Icons: ui\*_ca.paa (tools\make_icons.py); models are ACE / vanilla.

